      "id": "biochemistry-5-card-1",
      "lesson_id": "biochemistry-5",
      "front": "Michaelis–Menten",
      "back": "v = Vmax[S]/(Km + [S]); Km is the [S] at half Vmax and is not generally a dissociation constant.",
